            "heading": "Bryntum Complete",
            "body_html": "<p>A supercharged component bundle with all the features of the Gantt, Scheduler, Scheduler Pro, Grid, Calendar and TaskBoard. Great value for applications that will be using multiple Bryntum products.</p>",
