        {
            "id": "block_agbryntum_partnership",
            "type": "partnership",
            "heading": "Your JavaScript toolkit just got bigger",
            "body_html": "<p>Following our 2025 <a href=\"https://blog.ag-grid.com/ag-grid-and-bryntum-join-forces-to-strengthen-developer-tooling-for-modern-web-applications/\">partnership with Bryntum</a>, the components you trust for data now sit alongside the best tools for scheduling and project planning.</p><p>You already trust AG Grid for your data, and the full Bryntum suite — Gantt, Scheduler, Calendar, Task Board, and more — brings that same standard to scheduling, planning, and task workflows across your app.</p>",
            "body_text": "Following our 2025 partnership with Bryntum, the components you trust for data now sit alongside the best tools for scheduling and project planning. You already trust AG Grid for your data, and the full Bryntum suite — Gantt, Scheduler, Calendar, Task Board, and more — brings that same standard to scheduling, planning, and task workflows across your app.",
            "logo_light_src": "/images/campaigns/bryntum-products/shared/ag-grid-x-bryntum-light.svg",
            "logo_dark_src": "/images/campaigns/bryntum-products/shared/ag-grid-x-bryntum-dark.svg",
            "logo_alt": "AG Grid x Bryntum partnership"
        },
        {
