            "modifiers": ["image", "reverse", "added-shadow"],
            "heading": "Feature Rich Gantt Chart",
            "body_html": "<p>Our Gantt chart is the most powerful JavaScript Gantt component available. It has an extensive API and a massive set of features that will cover all your project management needs. The Gantt chart is built with pure JavaScript / TypeScript and integrates easily into any React, Angular or Vue application.</p>",
            "body_text": "Our Gantt chart is the most powerful JavaScript Gantt component available. It has an extensive API and a massive set of features that will cover all your project management needs. The Gantt chart is built with pure JavaScript / TypeScript and integrates easily into any React, Angular or Vue application.",
