            "body_html": "<p>With our modern Calendar component you get a full calendar solution with day, week, month, year and agenda views. We also include a set of nice looking widgets such as filters, event editor, month navigation bar and more.</p>",
            "body_text": "With our modern Calendar component you get a full calendar solution with day, week, month, year and agenda views. We also include a set of nice looking widgets such as filters, event editor, month navigation bar and more.",
